100000x &= 66666.\overline{666}\\
1000x &= 666.\overline{666}
\end{align*} Subtracting the second from the first gives $99900x=66000$, so $x=\frac{66000}{99900}=\frac{22}{33}$. Next, let $y=1.\overline{333}=1.33333\ldots$. Similarly, we have \begin{align*}
100000y &= 133333.\overline{333}\\
1000y &= 1333.\overline{333}
\end{align*} Subtracting the second from the first gives $99900y=132000$, so $y=\frac{132}{99}$. Then the desired quotient is $\frac{y}{x} = \frac{132/99}{22/33} = \frac{132}{99}\cdot\frac{33}{22} = \boxed{\frac{2}{3}\cdot 3 =2}$.
