We need to remove toothpicks on $H_5$, which is the hexagon 15 sides.  That is, we need toothpicks 1 through 5.  Or toothpicks 6 through 10.  Or toothpicks 7 through 12.  So 6 specifically do not help for the formation of all the triangles.

