Equality occurs if and only if $C$ lies directly above $O.$ From right triangle $BOE,$ $OB = \sqrt{1 + \frac{1}{4}} = \frac{\sqrt{5}}{2},$ so $2BC = AB + BC = 2\left(\frac{\sqrt{5}}{2}\right) = \boxed{\sqrt{5}}.$

